    show leo12_14
    with dissolve
    y "不，关系到——我很高兴听到这话。"
    scene bg black
    show leo12_13
    with dissolve
    leo "我明白了……{w}我们明天再谈吧。图书馆对你方便吗？"
    scene bg black
    show leo12_12
